---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="section about-contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <article class="about-panel reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">The human layer</p>
    <h2>I like software that gives teams room to move.</h2>
    <p>
      I am a software engineer based in Sofia, Bulgaria. My work sits between product engineering
      and platform thinking: understanding where systems slow people down, then designing cleaner
      paths through that complexity.
    </p>
    <p>
      I am especially drawn to projects where architecture, communication, rollout, documentation,
      and adoption all matter.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before software engineering, I worked in client-facing financial operations. That experience
      still shapes how I communicate technical trade-offs today.
    </p>
  </article>
  <aside class="contact-panel reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Build the next system</p>
    <h2 id="contact-title">Looking for someone who can bring structure to complex systems?</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Good conversations usually start with a messy system, an ambitious product goal, or a feature
      that deserves to become a platform.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="button primary" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>Email me</a>
      <a class="button" href="https://www.linkedin.com/" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
      <a class="button" href="/resume.pdf">Resume</a>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>
